1
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:05,470
First day, Sarge! How long does a Guardsman usually last?

2
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,159
Fifteen hours, son.

3
00:00:08,709 --> 00:00:11,557
...And how long have I been here?

4
00:00:12,207 --> 00:00:13,817
Fourteen.

5
00:00:15,167 --> 00:00:17,192
WAAAAAGH!

6
00:00:17,792 --> 00:00:19,191
Retreat?!

7
00:00:19,261 --> 00:00:21,253
Retreat is heresy, Private.

8
00:00:22,203 --> 00:00:24,537
FOR THE EMPERORRR!

9
00:00:25,437 --> 00:00:27,958
...He actually hit something.

10
00:00:28,658 --> 00:00:31,976
One Ork slain. The Emperor is pleased.

11
00:00:32,576 --> 00:00:35,949
Congrats, kid. You've got one hour left.

12
00:00:36,599 --> 00:00:37,933
...gulp.

